    {
      "title": "Coordinated LIR in force 1 January 2026, Nov 2026",
      "note": "Tariff (art. 118) confirmed for 2026; class rules: class 1 (art. 120), class 1a (art. 120bis: tariff on income less a quarter of its complement to €79,380, maximum marginal rates 39/40/41/42% above €51,804), class 2 splitting (art. 121); single-parent credit (art. 154ter: €3,504, tapering by 0.0612 between €60,000 and €105,000, €750 above). Solidarity surcharge thresholds €150,000 (classes 1, 1a) and €300,000 (class 2) from the ACD fonds pour l'emploi page."
